  "plan": "Write cli_tool.cpp that: (1) reads weights.json via cJSON, (2) decodes image.png via lodepng, (3) converts to 28x28 grayscale taking the R channel, applies MNIST normalization (x/255-0.1307)/0.3081, (4) runs three linear+ReLU layers, (5) prints the predicted digit with no extra text and writes prediction.txt next to the weights file. Then compile with g++ linking cJSON.c and lodepng.cpp, and test.",
